OL,3,GNEWSATip to reopen with #400,000
OL,4,Aculture cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA recycling centre which was closed two
OL,7,Fyears ago is to reopen with #400,000
OL,8,Fdiverted from culture funding.
OL,10,FSugden End Recycling Centre, near
OL,11,FKeighley, West Yorkshire, was closed by
OL,12,Fthe then Labour-run Bradford Council in
OL,13,F2024 as part of cost cutting measures.
OL,15,FEarlier this month, the Reform UK-led
OL,16,Fexecutive voted to reopen the site,
OL,17,Fwhich would be funded by
OL,18,F"de-prioritising" money for cultural
OL,19,Fevents such as markets, festivals and
OL,20,Fconcerts in the district.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
