OL,3,GNEWSATip to reopen with #400,000
OL,4,Aculture cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision was called in for further
OL,7,Fdebate on Tuesday but the committee
OL,8,Fvoted to implement the decision
OL,9,Fimmediately. Reform councillor Ian
OL,10,FWalker said: "Opening up Sugden End
OL,11,Fwill benefit more people than cultural
OL,12,Fsubsidies."
